<title>USA: Mallinckrodt Inc Q3 March 31 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Mallinckrodt Inc Q3 March 31 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.71		    $0.60</p>
<p> Oper net		   53,600		   45,600</p>
<p> Revs			578,100		  572,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   75,179		   75,525</p>
<p>			 9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $1.78		    $1.45</p>
<p> Oper net		  134,600		  111,400</p>
<p> Revs		    1,690,600		1,592,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   75,416		   76,670</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Figures exclude income from discontinued operations of $270.3 million, or $3.60/shr vs $2.8 million, or $0.04/shr in Q3, and $268.2 million, or $3.56/shr vs $111.4 million, or $0.44/shr in nine mos.</p>
<p>1997 9-mos earnings from continuing ops includes one-time R&amp;D charge of $6 million, or $3.8 million after taxes, or $0.05/shr.</p>
<p>1996 9-mos include non-cash charge for write-off of purchased R&amp;D of $3.7 million, or $2.3 after taxes, or $0.03/shr, relating to Syntro Corp acquisition.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
